CORE
template-refined.sh
--resolve-dynamic-sites
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[shell-dynamic-site\.1\] .* "echo installing "\*" >&2": SUCCESS$
^\[shell-unsupported\.1\] .* the parts of the text of eval for the holes of "echo installing "\*" >&2" are words .*: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
With refined strings, the value matches a template with a suffix. The
suffix was compared as a payload (a length and a pointer) rather than as
a string, so that it never matched.
